bug_report:
[12 Regression] -Wstringop-overflow false positive for __builtin_memmove from vector::insert
Repro on GCC 13.3 and 14:https://godbolt.org/z/EdfGEfGcrcode:
```
#include <cstdint>
#include <vector>

class buffer {
    void push(std::vector<std::uint8_t> chunk);
    std::vector<std::uint8_t> _data;
};
void buffer::push(std::vector<std::uint8_t> chunk) {
    if (_data.empty()) {
        _data.swap(chunk);
    } else {
        _data.insert(_data.end(), chunk.begin(), chunk.end());
    }
}
```
As you can see, perfectly normal.

